## Deployment

This project is deployed on Render.

### Build Command
pip install -r requirements.txt

### Start Command
uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port $PORT

### Environment Variables
- DATABASE_HOSTNAME
- DATABASE_PORT
- DATABASE_NAME
- DATABASE_USERNAME
- DATABASE_PASSWORD
- SECRET_KEY
- ALGORITHM
- ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES
- PYTHON_VERSION=3.12.10